{"seq":1,"slug":"mixture-design","title":"混合设计：FineWeb-Edu 与配比实验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/mixtures-curriculum/mixture-design","wordCount":1829,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"混合设计-fineweb-edu-与配比实验\">混合设计：FineWeb-Edu 与配比实验</h1><p>决定一个七十亿参数模型能吃到什么&quot;营养配比&quot;的，可能是一群只有两三亿参数的代理模型——DoReMi 用小组极小极大优化训练代理模型自动学出领域权重，全程不需要知道下游任务是问答还是摘要（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10429\">DoReMi</a>）。混合设计（mixture design）研究的就是这个问题：给定网页、书籍、代码、论文等候选域，各占多少比例能让最终模型最强。它曾是资深工程师的手感活，如今正在变成一门有公式、有回归、有标准流程的实验科学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>预训练语料由多个域组成，域权重向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\alpha} = (\\alpha_1, \\dots, \\alpha_K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">α</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i \\alpha_i = 1,\\ \\alpha_i \\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。同样的 token 总量，不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可以造成下游性能的显著差异——GPT-3 时代这组数字靠团队直觉拍板并写进论文附录，如今则由系统实验驱动：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;候选语料池&lt;br/&gt;按域分片&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;小规模训练网格&lt;br/&gt;多种 alpha 组合&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;评测信号&lt;br/&gt;损失 / 下游基准&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;配比推断&lt;br/&gt;DRO / 回归 / 定律拟合&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;重采样全量数据&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;大模型正式训练&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G{&quot;结果达标?&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| B&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| H[&quot;冻结配方&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"候选语料池&lt;br/&gt;按域分片\"] --&gt; B[\"小规模训练网格&lt;br/&gt;多种 alpha 组合\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"评测信号&lt;br/&gt;损失 / 下游基准\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"配比推断&lt;br/&gt;DRO / 回归 / 定律拟合\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"重采样全量数据\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"大模型正式训练\"]\n    F --&gt; G{\"结果达标?\"}\n    G --&gt;|\"否\"| B\n    G --&gt;|\"是\"| H[\"冻结配方\"]</pre><p>主流自动化方法的对比如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>信号来源</th>\n<th>需下游标注</th>\n<th>额外算力</th>\n<th>核心假设</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人工消融</td>\n<td>直接基准评测</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>小尺度结论可迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DoReMi</td>\n<td>代理模型最坏域损失</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>域间损失均衡有益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RegMix</td>\n<td>小模型网格 + 回归预测</td>\n<td>半需要</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>性能随配比可回归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据混合定律</td>\n<td>少数锚点 + 函数形式</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>损失满足可加幂律</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"doremi-让最弱的域说话\">DoReMi：让最弱的域说话</h2><p>DoReMi 的洞察是把配比问题转化为分布鲁棒优化：训练一个小型代理模型，其目标是让<strong>最坏表现域</strong>的损失最小化，由此得到的域权重天然向欠代表域倾斜。用这些权重重采样后训练正式模型，下游精度获得提升且无需任何下游任务知识。方法的价值在于把&quot;公平性直觉&quot;变成了可优化的目标函数——网页域因为数据海量总想霸占预算，Group DRO 的极小极大博弈替你按住它的手。局限同样清晰：最坏域损失的均衡未必等于下游最优，对真正重要的少数域（如代码）仍需人工上权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回归外推与混合定律\">回归外推与混合定律</h2><p>RegMix 把问题改写成回归任务：在多个小模型上跑遍多样的配比网格，以每个配比下的下游表现为因变量拟合回归面，再用回归面外推出大模型的最优配比（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.01492\">RegMix</a>）。它验证了一个关键经验：小模型上的最优配比与大模型高度相关但并不重合，直接平移会错失增益。数据混合定律走得更远——它主张各域损失关于配比系数存在函数形式的可预测性，于是只需少量锚点实验即可拟合出整张损失曲面，再把任意下游权重偏好表达为约束优化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">α</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}} \\sum_k w_k L_k(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum_i \\alpha_i = 1,\\ \\alpha_i \\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol mtight\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">α</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是对各能力域的偏好权重（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.16952\">Data Mixing Laws</a>）。这条路线把数千次消融压缩为十几次锚点加一次解析求解，代价是依赖函数形式假设在你的语料上成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fineweb-edu-阈值就是配方\">FineWeb-Edu：阈值就是配方</h2><p>FineWeb-Edu 展示了另一种配比思路：不调域间权重，而是在单一网页域内部用质量分类器切出分层子集，让&quot;教育分数阈值&quot;成为新的配比旋钮（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.17557\">FineWeb</a>）。高阈值子集在知识与推理基准上一骑绝尘，低阈值子集保住了多样性——两档之间的取舍正是<a href=\"../cleaning-filtering/quality-filtering\">质量过滤强度</a>与配比设计的交汇点。Nemotron-CC 给出第三种姿态：与其硬过滤丢弃九成数据，不如用分类器集成温和分级，再对中段文档做合成改写提纯，把&quot;配比&quot;从离散的删留决策变成连续的重构光谱（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.02595\">Nemotron-CC</a>）。与之配套的还有训练后期实践：多份公开报告描述了退火阶段——学习率衰减的最后一段切换到高质量子集为主的混合——相当于在时间维度上给课程收尾，<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.02737\">SmolLM2</a> 的数据为中心配方即包含此类设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"课程式时序安排\">课程式时序安排</h2><p>域权重之外还有第二个自由度：同一配方在训练进程的不同阶段可以不同。多份公开报告描述的退火实践是典型——学习率衰减的最后一段切换到高质量子集为主的混合，相当于在模型即将定型的窗口期投喂最易吸收的营养。这种时序安排的理论依据与课程学习一脉相承：训练早期需要广度覆盖来建立表征，后期需要密度来打磨能力。操作上它引入了新的调度超参数：切换点选在损失曲线的哪个位置、退火段占总 token 的比例、以及切换时是否伴随数据分布的渐变而非突变。这些选择目前仍靠小规模网格搜索，尚无公认公式。</p>\n<p>时序视角也统一了几个看似零散的现象。中训练（mid-training）环节——在预训练主体与退火之间插入长上下文或专项能力的加餐阶段——本质是把配比问题沿时间轴切得更细；而合成数据的投放节奏同样属于此类决策：早期投放利于表征形成，后期投放利于能力收敛，两条路线都有支持者。把&quot;什么时间喂什么&quot;当作与&quot;总共喂多少&quot;平级的问题来设计，是现代数据配方的成熟标志。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实验纪律-别让脏尺子毁掉配方\">实验纪律：别让脏尺子毁掉配方</h2><p>配比实验的全部结论都建立在消融评测之上，因此评测卫生是方法论的地基——若验证集被污染，你会把&quot;保留了更多原题&quot;的配比误判为更优，这类陷阱的处理见<a href=\"../cleaning-filtering/benchmark-decontamination\">评测去污染</a>。第二条纪律是小尺度外推的风险管理：过滤与配比的收益并非总能跨算力尺度迁移，正式放大前应保留一档中等规模的确认实验，理由在<a href=\"data-scaling-behavior\">数据侧的扩展行为</a>中展开。把纪律压缩成三条：先修评测卫生再跑网格；小尺度结论只迁移方向、不迁移数值；中规模确认实验的预算在总盘子里预先锁定。最后，当合成数据成为混合物的一部分时，配比问题多了一层自指结构——合成流的加入会改变分类器打分的分布，进而反馈到下一次配比决策，这条回路的稳定条件是当前合成数据研究的活跃前沿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>配比正从手感走向科学：DoReMi 免下游标注、RegMix 回归外推、数据混合定律解析求解。</li>\n<li>FineWeb-Edu 证明质量阈值本身就是配比旋钮，退火时序则把配方沿训练进程展开。</li>\n<li>一切方法的共同前提：干净的评测尺子，加一档对外推风险的中规模确认实验。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"混合设计：FineWeb-Edu 与配比实验","id":"混合设计-fineweb-edu-与配比实验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DoReMi：让最弱的域说话","id":"doremi-让最弱的域说话"},{"level":2,"text":"回归外推与混合定律","id":"回归外推与混合定律"},{"level":2,"text":"FineWeb-Edu：阈值就是配方","id":"fineweb-edu-阈值就是配方"},{"level":2,"text":"课程式时序安排","id":"课程式时序安排"},{"level":2,"text":"实验纪律：别让脏尺子毁掉配方","id":"实验纪律-别让脏尺子毁掉配方"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"评测去污染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/cleaning-filtering/benchmark-decontamination"},"next":{"title":"数据侧的扩展行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/mixtures-curriculum/data-scaling-behavior"}}